  "intent": "Two branches are compared, each route reaching across to the other. Light: the top branch's route pulls back toward its commit, which swells as it gathers it, then draws out again down and across; its arrowhead rides in on the tip, lands with a hit, thrusts toward the other branch, recoils and settles; the bottom branch answers a beat later the opposite way, up and across. Strong: both commits gather longer, the routes shoot out faster and the arrowheads thrust further and settle in two beats. The commits never shrink.",
